OL,3,ATeenage girl admits murder in row over
OL,4,Aboy
OL,5,
OL,6,FDowling, 18, who took Chloe to the
OL,7,Fhouse in Kennerleigh Avenue in Leeds,
OL,8,Fand Archie Rycroft, 20, who followed
OL,9,FSmith to the fight, are also charged
OL,10,Fwith murder and manslaughter and their
OL,11,Ftrial will continue. They both deny the
OL,12,Fcharges against them.
